# Ship only when asked

Keep game and bot work **local** until the user explicitly says to ship.

Do **not** unless they asked in this conversation:

- Vercel / production deploys
- `git push` (GitHub, Origin, or any remote)
- Bot-hosting restarts, panel deploys, or telling them to pull on the host so production updates

Edit, run, and test on the machine. When they say deploy, push, or update the host, then do that step.

Still never force-push, amend others’ commits, or commit secrets.
